  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the burden of TB in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program supports an organisation called In But Free working with the prison sector on combating tuberculosis among inmates.  IBF provides training and creates awareness within the sector, they work on prevention and care, they help find more people sick with TB and help these through treatment. The program outcome is that the rights and needs of people affected by TB are met. The project focusses on the rights and needs of men, women and children affected by TB through a gender sensitive and rights based approach. TB and gender analysis are undertaken and actions adjusted according.</narrative>
  </description>
